---
/**
 * Compact 3-step illustrated OBS Virtual Camera quick reference strip
 * shared by /zoom and /google-meet, linking to the full-size /obs guide.
 */
---

<div class="pt-3 space-y-3">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
    <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">
      Visual OBS Quick Reference (3 Clicks)
    </span>
    <a
      href="/obs"
      class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-ink underline decoration-accent decoration-2 underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-85 transition"
    >
      Full-size OBS guide →
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
    <a href="/obs#step-import" class="group rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-edge bg-surface flex flex-col hover:border-accent transition">
      <div class="aspect-video bg-[#0B1218] overflow-hidden">
        <img
          src="/images/guides/obs-step-1-import.webp"
          alt="OBS Studio Scene Collection menu with Import highlighted"
          width="1024"
          height="885"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-200"
        />
      </div>
      <span class="px-3 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
        1. Scene Collection → Import
      </span>
    </a>

    <a href="/obs#step-select" class="group rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-edge bg-surface flex flex-col hover:border-accent transition">
      <div class="aspect-video bg-[#0B1218] overflow-hidden">
        <img
          src="/images/guides/obs-step-2-select-collection.webp"
          alt="Selecting the imported PhoneWebcam Scene Collection in OBS"
          width="1024"
          height="697"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-200"
        />
      </div>
      <span class="px-3 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
        2. Select PhoneWebcam-XXXX
      </span>
    </a>

    <a href="/obs#step-virtual-cam" class="group rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-edge bg-surface flex flex-col hover:border-accent transition">
      <div class="aspect-video bg-[#0B1218] overflow-hidden">
        <img
          src="/images/guides/obs-step-3-virtual-camera.webp"
          alt="Selecting the PhoneWebcam scene and clicking Start Virtual Camera in OBS"
          width="1024"
          height="576"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-200"
        />
      </div>
      <span class="px-3 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
        3. Click Start Virtual Camera
      </span>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
